                "metadata": {
                    "description": "Dive into the St. Patrick's Day spirit with a lively playlist featuring Dive Deep Questions to spark curiosity, intriguing Fun Facts about the holiday, and an exciting Scavenger Hunt for themed treasures. Engage in playful Would You Rather games, and get immersed in a heartwarming story of kindness. Complemented by a printable coloring/activity book, this collection is perfect for fostering creativity, learning, and festive fun, making it an ideal way to celebrate St. Patrick's Day with kids.",
